|passage="... buy what he wants. It's none of your '''nevermind'''."}}
#* {{quote-book|title=Blood at Bear Lake‎|page=76|author=Gary Franklin|year=2008|passage="These is my brothers, Tom and Benjamin. We's from Missoura. Would you be Yankee or Secesh?" / "Neither one," Joe said. "Not that it's any '''nevermind''' o' yours, Mr. Wickersham."}}
